# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 05 CANCEL EDGE CASES (including "cancel during match")
# The engine is single-threaded and each command is atomic, so a cancel can
# never interleave with a match; it is sequenced before or after. What must
# work is the lazy-deletion machinery the heap relies on.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PLACE 1 A SELL LIMIT 100 5 GTC
PLACE 2 B SELL LIMIT 100 5 GTC
PLACE 3 C SELL LIMIT 100 5 GTC
PLACE 4 D SELL LIMIT 101 5 GTC
# Cancelling the best order: top of book must move to #2 immediately.
CANCEL 1
TOP
# Cancelling from the MIDDLE of the heap: #3 becomes a buried tombstone.
CANCEL 3
DEPTH ORDERS
# An aggressor sweeping the book must skip the tombstone mid-match:
# expect #2 5@100 then #4 3@101 -- never #3.
PLACE 5 X BUY LIMIT 101 8 GTC
# Cancel after a partial fill cancels only the leaves (2), fills stand.
CANCEL 4
STATUS 4
# Rejections:
CANCEL 2          # fully filled   -> ALREADY_FILLED
CANCEL 1          # double cancel  -> ALREADY_CANCELLED
CANCEL 999        # never existed  -> UNKNOWN_ORDER
PLACE 1 A BUY LIMIT 90 1 GTC     # ids are never reusable -> DUPLICATE_ORDER_ID
# "Cancel arriving while the order is being matched": the aggressor (#7) is
# sequenced first and fills #6 completely; the cancel, sequenced next, is
# too late. Output is the same on every replay.
PLACE 6 E SELL LIMIT 102 5 GTC
PLACE 7 F BUY LIMIT 102 5 GTC
CANCEL 6
# Same race, other order: cancel first, then aggressor finds nothing and rests.
PLACE 8 E SELL LIMIT 103 5 GTC
CANCEL 8
PLACE 9 F BUY LIMIT 103 5 GTC
# An order cancelled BY the match itself (STP cancel-resting) is terminal.
CONFIG STP CANCEL_RESTING
PLACE 10 G SELL LIMIT 104 5 GTC
PLACE 11 F SELL LIMIT 103 1 GTC   # F's own bid #9 at 103 -> STP cancels #9, #11 rests
CANCEL 9
CANCEL 11
TOP
DEPTH ORDERS